  // Nyman 1950 (Uppsala PhD) + Bercovici-Foias 1984 (J. Funct. Anal. 56 (1984)
  // 168-182) functional-analytic RH-equivalent criterion + the BBLS-05
  // quantitative form (Balazard-Saias 2005 J. Number Theory 115 234-260).
